  "id": "amblyopia",
  "term": "amblyopia",
  "definition": "Amblyopia is a general term for impaired vision. It can refer to reduced vision linked to abnormal development in the visual cortex when the two eyes send mismatched input, or to vision loss related to optic nerve damage from toxins such as alcohol, tobacco, or some medications.",
